    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Don’t miss the phenomenal Swiss-Ecuadorian guitar duo Hermanos Gutiérrez, performing for the very first time in a symphonic setting! From the vast, arid expanse of an imaginary Wild West to the bright glow of a sonic cosmos, and through the nostalgic musical atmosphere of 1960s Italian cinema, this world premiere promises an unforgettable journey into a one-of-a-kind Latin-inspired soundscape."
