        "@value": "<span class=\"TextRun SCXW96947785 BCX0\" lang=\"FR-CA\" xml:lang=\"FR-CA\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW96947785 BCX0\">This program highlig..."
