    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Four exceptional performers come together to present the final leg of their Quebec tours, joined by the OSM conducted by Jean-Michel Malouf in symphonic arrangements by Benoit Groulx. To open this concert, Luce Dufault will sing the love-inspired excerpt from her show Dire combien je t’aime. In the second part, Marie Denise Pelletier, Marie Carmen and Joe Bocan celebrate the breakthrough hit Pour une histoire d’un soir, a musical narrative of friendship and shared passion."
      }
    ],
