        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Mozart and Fauré with Louis Lortie and Eun Sun Kim - Orchestre symphonique de Montréal"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "To music lovers’ great delight, pianist Louis Lortie will be back with the OSM to take us on a jaunt from the world of Mozart’s Vienna to the Parisian concert halls in the time of Fauré. Music Director of the San Francisco Opera Eun Sun Kim will also conduct Mussorgsky’s Pictures at an Exhibition, a highly imaginative and vividly coloured work enlivened by Ravel’s brilliant orchestration."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/inLanguage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
