      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>This year, our “Éclaté” concert celebrates Spain, spotlighting this country’s mesmerizing dances and music! You will be irresistibly drawn by the fiery melodies and lively rhythms of Chabrier, Granados, and Manuel de Falla, including the latter’s impassioned and outlandish stories in <em>El amor brujo</em> and <em>El sombrero de tres picos</em>. Guitar, castanets, and flamenco dancing will complete this embodiment of exuberant Spain! After the concert, join the party in the foyers of the Maison symphonique and make your way to the dance floor!</p>\n"
      }
    ]
