        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>Thomas Le Duc-Moreau conducts the OSM and three OSM Competition winners in a concert celebrating the next generation of musicians and the beauty of the concerto form.<br />\n<strong>Recommended for students in elementary cycle 3 and secondary 1 and 2</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.osm.ca/en/news/my-dear-concerto-pedagogical-guide/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>See pedagogical guide</strong></a></p>\n"
