    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>Like a bracing and invigorating wind, this concert features Mendelssohn’s Concerto for Violin and Piano, an early masterpiece that brings together Andrew Wan and Charles Richard-Hamelin.</p>\n"
