    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "From the legends of Benin, celebrated by singer Angélique Kidjo, to the rustic landscapes unfolding in the “Pastoral” Symphony, join us for a delightful moment of escape! HAPPY SYMPHONIC HOUR Starting at 5:30 p.m. after the concert, enjoy a drink at the Maison symphonique bar and meet comedian Philippe-Audrey Larrue-St-Jacques in a convivial atmosphere. In addition, this concert offers an immersive experience thanks to a real-time listening guide. Click here to find out more!"
      }
