      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Dive into the fascinating world of percussion instruments with the minimalist and captivating music of Philip Glass. Let yourself be carried away by the power and energy of these instruments to experience an intense and unforgettable sonic adventure. A unique opportunity to discover the exceptional acoustics of the Maison symphonique alongside the virtuoso percussionists of the OSM!"
