        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Rising star Marie-Ange Nguci makes her OSM debut in Rachmaninoff’s Piano Concerto no. 3, a work of dazzling bravura. SYMPHONIC HAPPY HOUR From 5:30 PM, enjoy a drink at the Maison symphonique bar and meet comedian Philippe-Audrey Larrue-St-Jacques in a convivial atmosphere. In addition, this concert offers an immersive experience thanks to a real-time listening guide. Click here to find out more!"
