    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>Rising star Marie-Ange Nguci makes her OSM debut in Rachmaninoff’s Piano Concerto no. 3, a work of dazzling bravura.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>SYMPHONIC HAPPY HOUR</strong></p>\n<p><strong>From 5:30 PM, enjoy a drink at the Maison symphonique bar and meet comedian Philippe-Audrey Larrue-St-Jacques in a convivial atmosphere.</strong></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.osm.ca/en/listening-guide-in-real-time/\">In addition, this concert offers an immersive experience thanks to a real-time listening guide. Click here to find out more!</a></strong></p>\n"
