    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>From channels to funnels of laughter, Aquaphonie is a street theatre clown show set in the realm of fantasy about a serious topic: protecting natural resources from disappearing.</p>\n<p>In a faraway, long-forgotten land, a group of water preservationists continues to work. Three aquanaut clowns are on a mission to index the Earth’s waters…when a leak in the main tank jeopardizes their plans. In a panic, the trio spurts out torrents of solutions, each one less effective than the last, but the stream of their imagination has no limits!</p>\n"
      }
    ]
