    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>A soft-spoken weasel travels the countryside with a guitar and a small suitcase, peddling magnificent neckties to farm animals. Sadly, no one ever takes an interest in her brightly coloured ties … So the little weasel decides to try her luck in the forest. That’s where she meets a hedgehog, who also loves music, and a capybara, who has crossed the seas with his accordion. Her life is about to change…</p>\n<p>OV movie (French &amp; Spanish) with English subtitles</p>\n<p>© JPL Films / Nadasdy Film</p>\n"
      }
    ]
