        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>The OSM invites you to experience ways of listening with your body, seeing with your ears, and sensing with your hands through dance, music and drawing.</p>\n<p>Activity adapted for children aged 3 to 12, with or without specific accommodations or needs.</p>\n"
