        "@value": "The Artcycle: Family Fun - Orchestre symphonique de Montréal"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Take inspiration from shared family memories to create your own work of art. This activity draws on genre painting, an artistic style that depicts moments in day-to-day life. Start by sketching a scene from your everyday life with crayons, then bring it to life with brightly coloured bingo markers. Let your creativity lead the way to illustrate the beauty of your family moment."
      }
    ],
