    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Work with your family to create a miniature sculpture using pipe cleaners and brightly coloured paper. To give shape to your imagination, observe your surroundings and be inspired by the sculptures of Aaron Curry and Angela Bulloch from the MMFA's public art collection. This activity will lead you to add colour and transform the space around you."
