        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Discovery Trail: Octobass, Bells and the Maison symphonique - Orchestre symphonique de Montréal"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This discovery trail has some resonant surprises in store: you’ll have the special privilege of touring the Maison symphonique, a magnificent concert hall with exceptional acoustics; you’ll get to view and hear the OSM’s ten newly acquired carillon bells, as well as learning about the largest instrument of the string family: the octobass! This activity is part of the Discovery Trail"
      }
    ],
