        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>The refined classicism of Mozart&rsquo;s <em>Sinfonia Concertante</em> paves the way for Schubert’s expansive <em>Ninth Symphony,</em> whose visionary scope and infectious energy make it one of the pinnacles of the Romantic repertoire.</p>\n<p>The concert is part of the Festival de Lanaudière at the Amphithéâtre Fernand-Lindsay</p>\n"
