    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Explore an extraordinary musical forest where brass, woodwinds, the organ, and percussion instruments come alive! You can try them out, listen to their sounds, and let specialists guide you.  Throughout the day, each family of instruments will exhibit itself through an immersive experience combining sounds and aromas, to stir your curiosity and your senses.  A marvellous stroll!"
