        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Musical Talk: Indigenous Throat Singing - Orchestre symphonique de Montréal"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Discover the fascinating world of Indigenous throat singing with Tiffany Ayalik and Inuksuk Mackay (duo PIQSIQ). This distinctive vocal art in which rhythm and breath combine in a lively dialogue will be explained through its history and techniques. In connection with the 4:00 p.m. concert in the Cinquième Salle."
      }
    ],
