    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>His impressive technique and the originality and depth of his interpretations make Martin Helmchen one of the most sought-after pianists on the international stage. Hear him in Mozart’s intense and passionate 24th Piano Concerto. Then, let yourself be captivated by the rich and moving voice of Beth Taylor, who brings out all the wonderful poetry of Elgar’s <em>Sea Pictures</em>.</p>\n"
