        "@value": "<p>From France to the United Kingdom, Scotland to Ireland, and a stop in Germany, music and poetry come together in this celebration of nature and love with an enchanting array of songs. The deeply expressive and richly nuanced voice of Beth Taylor unites with the artistry of pianist Esther Gonthier for a musical moment of intricate and multifaceted emotions.</p>\n"
