      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Trick or Treat!  - Orchestre symphonique de Montréal"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Have you ever wondered if the Maison Symphonique might be haunted by monsters and vampires? Could a conductor’s baton double as a magic wand? What if music truly held magical powers? To find out, dress up in your best costume and step into a world of imagination, where you’ll hear strange tales told by mysterious creatures. Let the magic of music sweep you away! In French / For ages 6 and up See pedagogical guide "
      }
