    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Through listening and discussion, the evening’s host will guide you through the highlights of selected concerts’ repertoire. Come learn more about these programs’ main musical themes and explore symphonic works with other concertgoers. Free admission. OSM subscribers have the exclusive privilege of reserving their spot in advance for the listening clubs. Please note that these events will be held in French only."
      }
