        "@value": "Recommended for Cycle 3 elementary students and Secondary I, II, and III students Presented in French Every two years, millions of people are inspired by the incredible feats of Olympic athletes. This concert invites audiences, young and old, to experience the stirring emotion of national anthems and the deep connection between rhythm and breath. Throughout history, music and sport have gone hand in hand—join us as we celebrate their enduring bond in spectacular fashion! A unique opportunity to mark the 50th anniversary of the Montreal Olympic Games and to celebrate the connection between music and sport! Consult the pedagogical guide"
