        "@value": "<p><strong>Cirque Le Monastère</strong><br />\n<strong>Alexandre Alain</strong>, aerial silks<br />\n<strong>Oona De Cleyn</strong>, hair suspension on bungee<br />\n<strong>Manolo Gonzalo</strong>, MultiLED number<br />\n<strong>Cléa Perion</strong>, Cyr wheel<br />\n<strong>Arthur Morel Van Hyfte</strong>, aerial prism<br />\n<strong>Camille Tremblay</strong>, balancing act<br />\n<strong>Guillaume Blais</strong>, creative director<br />\n<strong>Marie-Ève Demers</strong>, choreographer</p>\n"
