      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Brass & Bells Shining Bright"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><strong>3 performances from 8 p.m. &#8211; 9:15 p.m. &#8211; 10:30 p.m.</strong></p>\n<p>Step into the Maison symphonique for a dazzling evening. A brilliant brass quintet will light up the stage, joined by the very first public presentation of the spectacular 15-bell carillon. Together, they will create shimmering, magical sounds designed to captivate audiences of all ages. This extraordinary program, crafted for a more intimate setting, is the perfect occasion for a first visit or a rediscovery of the Orchestre symphonique de Montréal’s musicians. Three 30-minute performances will highlight the evening, beginning with a special introduction to the bells and culminating in a luminous concert. To make the night even more memorable, the Maison symphonique will open its doors for an exclusive self-guided tour. An unforgettable celebration of sound, light, and discovery with a hint of magic.</p>\n<p><em>The carillon bells of the Orchestre symphonique de Montréal were generously donated by Canimex, Drummondville, Quebec, Canada.</em></p>\n"
      }
    ]
  },
