    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Experience the intensity of the Concours musical international de Montréal’s Final with the Orchestre symphonique de Montréal—the Concours’ official orchestra—under the baton of guest conductor Sascha Goetzel. In the first evening of the Final, dedicated to the music of Mozart, on June 3 at 7:30 p.m., five finalists compete with elegance and virtuosity. Discover how these young violinists interpret Mozart's genius and bring their personalities to life through the pages of the Viennese master's music. A moment of finesse and pure emotion that will determine the three finalists for the Concours musical international de Montréal 2026’s Grand Final. Choice of concertos: Mozart’s violin concertos nos 1 to 4."
      }
    ],
